   "children": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<h2>Highway 90 Dispensary FAQs</h2>"
    },
    {
     "t": "group",
     "id": "tpl",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "1e3e3d50",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "faq",
         "items": [
          {
           "q": "Where is Highway 90 located?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Highway 90 Dispensary is located at 90 Old Marlton Pike W., Marlton NJ. 08053 We are easily accessible to customers in the area, offering a wide range of high-quality products including <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a> <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, and more. Visit us during our operating hours to explore what we have to offer!</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "What are the operating hours of Highway 90?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Highway 90 is open the following hours for your convenience:<br>Monday – Sunday 9am-10pm<br><br></p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Do I need a medical card to purchase products at Highway 90?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>No, we serve recreational customers. A valid ID showing you are 21+ is required for recreational purchases.</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Can I place an order online for pickup?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Yes, you can browse our product selection and place an order online for quick and easy pickup. Online ordering has a cutoff time of 9:30pm and orders are NOT held overnight.</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "What types of cannabis products does Highway 90 offer?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>We offer a wide range of high-quality products including <a href=\"/categoires/flower/\">Flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">Edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">Pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">Vapes</a> and <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">Concentrates</a> as well as top <a href=\"/brands/\">brands</a>. Visit us during our operating hours to explore what we have to offer!</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Are Highway 90's products lab-tested for quality and safety?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Yes, all our products undergo rigorous testing to ensure they meet the highest quality and safety standards</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Can Highway 90 give me recommendations on which products to choose?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<p>Absolutely! Our knowledgeable staff is here to provide guidance and answer any questions you may have about cannabis products.</p>"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
