   "children": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<h2>Looking for the Best Dispensary Near Me in Marlton, NJ?</h2><p>Finding the <strong>best dispensary near Marlton, NJ</strong> shouldn’t mean choosing between affordable cannabis, quality products, and great customer service. At <strong>Highway 90 Dispensary</strong>, we believe you deserve all three.</p><p>Conveniently located at <strong>90 Old Marlton Pike in Marlton, New Jersey</strong>, Highway 90 proudly serves cannabis shoppers from Marlton, Evesham, Cherry Hill, Mount Laurel, Medford, Voorhees, and surrounding South Jersey communities.</p><p>Whether you’re purchasing recreational cannabis for the first time or you’re an experienced shopper comparing products and prices, our mission is simple: <strong>make every visit welcoming, informative, affordable, and worth coming back for.</strong></p><h2>A Highly Rated Marlton Dispensary Where Customer Service Comes First</h2><p>What makes a great dispensary? We believe it starts with the people.</p><p>Highway 90 has earned a <strong>4.9-star Google rating</strong>, with hundreds of customer reviews highlighting our knowledgeable staff, friendly atmosphere, competitive pricing, and personalized recommendations.</p><p>Our team takes the time to listen, answer questions, and help you explore products without pressure. New to cannabis? We’ll walk you through product types, THC potency, terpene information, and consumption methods. Already know your favorite brands? We’ll help you discover comparable products, new arrivals, and worthwhile deals.</p><p>We don’t believe shopping for cannabis should feel intimidating, complicated, or rushed.</p><p><strong>At Highway 90, you’re more than another transaction. You’re our neighbor.</strong></p><h2>More Cannabis for Your Money: Deals, Discounts, and Everyday Value</h2><p>Great customer service gets people through the door. Great value gives them another reason to return.</p><p>Highway 90 offers competitive cannabis pricing, rotating specials, and opportunities to save on popular products and brands.</p><p><strong>Our new customer savings include:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>35% off your first purchase</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>20% off your second purchase</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>25% off your third purchase</strong></p></li></ul><p>But savings don’t end after your first three visits.</p><p>Explore our frequently updated <a href=\"/specials/\">cannabis deals and specials</a> for discounts on flower, pre-rolls, vaporizers, edibles, and more. Looking for budget-friendly options? Our <strong>$20 &amp; Under</strong> selection makes finding affordable cannabis even easier.</p><p>Highway 90 Rewards provides additional opportunities for returning customers to get more value from their purchases.</p><p>Promotions are subject to availability, eligibility, and applicable exclusions. Check our website for current offers.</p><h2>Quality Cannabis Products for Every Preference and Budget</h2><p>Whether you’re looking for premium cannabis flower, convenient pre-rolls, vape cartridges, edibles, concentrates, infused beverages, tinctures, or topicals, Highway 90 offers a diverse selection to explore.</p><p>Our online menu helps customers compare products, browse current specials, discover staff favorites, and shop by category.</p><p>We believe informed customers make better purchasing decisions. That’s why our staff is available to explain product differences and help you find options aligned with your preferences and budget.</p><h2>Convenient Cannabis Shopping Near Cherry Hill, Mount Laurel, and Medford</h2><p>Highway 90 makes shopping easy with <strong>online ordering and in-store pickup</strong>.</p><p>Browse available inventory, compare prices, and place your order before arriving. Our convenient Marlton location makes Highway 90 a practical choice for customers throughout Burlington and Camden counties.</p><p><strong>We’re open seven days a week, from 9 AM to 10 PM</strong>, so you can shop when it works for your schedule.</p><h2>Why Choose Highway 90 Over Other South Jersey Dispensaries?</h2><p>Because the best dispensary experience isn’t just about what you buy. It’s about how you’re treated and the value you receive.</p><p>At Highway 90, we bring together knowledgeable people, genuine customer care, competitive pricing, recurring promotions, convenient shopping, and an extensive cannabis selection.</p><p>Our customers’ reviews tell that story better than any advertisement.</p><p><strong>When you’re searching for the best dispensary near me in Marlton, discover a place that makes customer satisfaction and everyday value a priority.</strong></p><h2>Visit Highway 90 Dispensary Today</h2><p><strong>Address:</strong> 90 Old Marlton Pike, Marlton, NJ 08053</p><p><strong>Hours:</strong> Monday–Sunday, 9 AM–10 PM</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> (856) 607-3473</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"/\">www.thehighway90.com</a></p><p>Recreational cannabis is available to adults 21 and older with valid identification. No medical card is required.</p><p><strong>Shop online, explore today’s deals, and discover why South Jersey cannabis customers keep coming back to Highway 90.</strong></p>"
